<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>唐诗三百首草书字帖</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'KaiTi', 'STKaiti', serif; /* 设置楷体，更有古风 */
            background-color: #f5f5dc; /* 米黄色背景，像宣纸 */
            color: #333;
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2.2em;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #333;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .poem {
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            background-color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .poem h2 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.8em;
        }
        .poem p {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.5em;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>唐诗三百首草书字帖</h1>
        
        <div class="poem">
            <h2>静夜思</h2>
            <p>李白</p>
            <p>床前明月光，<br>疑是地上霜。<br>举头望明月，<br>低头思故乡。</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
